 "text": "Treasurer | Mackinac County\nHome\nDepartments\nAirport Manager\nAnimal Control\nAnimal Shelter\nCounty Clerk\nCommissioners\nCourts\n911 & Emergency Management\nEqualization\nFriend of the Court\nGIS\nPlanning Commission\nProsecutor\nRegister of Deeds\nRoad Commission\nSheriff’s Office\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nVeterans’ Services\nCommunity\nCourthouse\nHistory & Historical Sites\nHolidays\nMackinac County Facts\nRequest For Proposals\nLocal Government\nCity Governments\nTownships\nTourism\nContact\nDepartments\nAirport Manager\nAnimal Control\nAnimal Shelter\nCounty Clerk\nCommissioners\nCourts\n911 & Emergency Management\nEqualization\nFriend of the Court\nPlanning Commission\nProsecutor\nRegister of Deeds\nRoad Commission\nSheriff’s Office\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nVeterans Affairs\nHome » Departments » Treasurer\nMackinac County Treasurer\nTina Massey\nMackinac County Treasurer’s Office\n100 S. Marley, Rm 30\nSt. Ignace, MI 49781\nPhone: (906) 643-7318\nFax: (906) 643-6745\nHours: 8:30 am – 4:30 pm M-F excluding holidays\nLocation: Second floor of the Courthouse\nThe principal functions of this office are to…\nreceive, maintain & disburse all county monies\nmanage the investments\nmaintain the records of receipts & disbursements of monies from all county departments\ncollect & distribute to all local governmental units the delinquent property taxes\nsell dog & kennel licenses\nhandle all the duties and responsibilities of the new property tax law, Public Act 123, including the summer auction of foreclosed properties\nhttps://tax-sale.info/\nDepartment Resources\nProperty Tax Information Search\nOnline Delinquent Tax Payment Service\nDog License Information\nDOG LICENSE FORM\nParcels for Auction\nTwp/City Treasurer List\nGIS MAPS\nMI Community Financial Dashboard\n2025 County Millages\nMackinac County Investment Policy 2025\n© Copyright 2026 Mackinac County, Michigan | All Rights Reserved | Website by MCGWD | Sitemap",
